            "answer": "<p>Lakeway and Bee Cave are separate cities with their own building departments and amendments. A permit there does not come from Austin. Steiner Ranch and many Lake Travis communities sit outside city limits, where the county and HOA set the process. Most of the area applies the IRC 36\" house guard height and the 48\" pool barrier. The office covering your address makes the call, so ask before ordering.</p>",
