            "text": "<p>Lakeway, Steiner Ranch, Hudson Bend and Tarrytown's Lake Austin shore are about the water view. A glass deck railing keeps it open, and the 2205 marine-grade hardware carries a 10-year no-rust promise. On a pool deck above the lake, the 46\" panel gives the 48\" barrier height.</p>"
